<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id">Zechariah</book>
  <para style="h">Zechariah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zechariah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zechariah</para>
  <para style="mt">Zechariah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Darius in kumpi a sep a kum nina, a hla giet hla-in, Iddo’ tapa Berechiah, a tapa kamsang Zechariah tungah Topa’ thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na pu na pate uh tungah Topa a lungthah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin amate kungah tam bangin gen in, Vanglien Topa in ci hi: Vanglien Topa in a genna-ah, keima kungah hing kilekia un, tua hile kei zong na kung vuah kang kilekia ding hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nidanga kamsangte in, “Na gitlona lampite ule na gitlo gamtatnate uh panin kilekia un,” ci-a a genna uh na pu na pate bang sih un. Ahi vangin amate in ka thugen za loin thusim lo uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na pu na pate uh hei-a om uh ahei? Tua kamsangte a hing zing uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin keima in ka nasem kamsangte tunga ka thupieh ahi, ka kammalte le ka thukhamte in na pu na pate uh’ hun lap hi lo amah? Tuaci’n amate kisiakia-in, “ Topa in bawl dinga a gelsa bangin i gamtat dan ule i silbawl utawh kituohin eite tunga ang bawl ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Darius in kumpi a sep a kum nina, a hla sawm le khatna, Shebat hla a ni sawmni le li ni-in Iddo’ tapa Berechiah, a tapa kamsang Zechariah tungah Topa’ thu a tung hi; tuale Zechariah in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />zan lai-in sakol san khat tunga a tuong pasal khat ka mu hi! Guom thuhpi sunga om mui singkungte lahah ama a ding hi; tuale ama nua lamah sakol a san, a buong, le a kangte a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in, “Ka pu aw, tam teng bang ahei?” ka ci hi. Kei ei hopi vantungmi in kei kungah, “Amate bang ahei ci kang lah ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n mui singkung lahah a ding mipa in, “Amate pen leitung a vil kawikawi dinga Topa in a sawl mite ahi uhi,” ci-in ei dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin mui singkung lahah a ding Topa’ vantungmi tawh amate a holim vua, “Leitung ka vil zo ta vua, en in, leitung buppi nuomtahin toi om uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ vantungmi in, “Vanglien Topa aw, tam kum sawm sagi sung na lungthahna ziehin Jerusalem le Judah khuopite tungah bang tanvei hepi loin om ding na hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in kamsiem le henepna tawh ka kihopi vantungmi a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n ka kiholimpi vantungmi in ka kungah, tami thu tam bangin phuongzah in: Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi; Jerusalem le Zion adingin ka laina mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuale a nuom op hit hiet minam tungah ka lung a thah mama hi; bangzieh ahei cile ka lungthahna tawmkhat beh ahi lai-in amate in gimna a nasiesah semsem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in tam bangin gen hi, kei Jerusalem ah lainatna tawh ka kilekia zo hi; tua sungah ka inn kilam ding a, Jerusalem tungah tena khau kihlung ding hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Phuongzah lai in: Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Nopsahna tawh ka khuopite a kidimlet ding uhi; Topa in Zion henemkia ding a, Jerusalem a teelkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka khuodah leh saki li ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka kihopi vantungmi kungah, “Tamte bang ahiei?” ci-in ka dong hi. Tuale ama in, “Tamte pen a kithethangsa ahi Judah, Israel, le Jerusalem sakite ahi uhi,” ci-in ei dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in siakheng mi li ei lah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuale keima in, “Amate bang bawl ding uh ahei?” ci-in ka dong hi. Ama in, “Koima in a lu a phawh thei lo nadinga Judah a thethang sakite ahi hi; hizongle tamte ahi uleh amate a zausah ding, Judah a thethang ding le a kite uh Judah gam langkhatah a sangkhan minamte’ kite a sattan dinga ang pei uh ahi hi,” ci-in ei dawng hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka ento leh a khut sungah tena khau a tawi mi khat ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in, “Hei-a pei ding na hei?” ci-in ka dong hi. Ama in, “Jerusalem khuopi adung avai bangtan a pha ei ci-a ka thei nadinga a te ding ka hi hi,” ci-in ei dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin ei hopi vantungmi pen a malam nawtin pei a, tuale vantung midang khat ma in a malam nawtin na dawntuo hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuale ama kungah, “Tai inlen tua tangvalpa kungah, “A sungah mihonpite le gangingte tampi a op ziehin kulpi a nei lo khuotate bangin Jerusalem ah mi kiteng ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama kimvelah meikuong kulpi-in ka om ding a, a sungah ama’ minthanna ka hi ding hi, Topa in ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khaile! khaile! Leilu lam gam panin taimang in, Topa in ci hi; azieh pen keima in van ningli-a huipi leng bangin gamdangah note kang thezah sieng ta hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khaile! No Babylon tanu tawh a tengtonte aw, na suohtah nadingun Zion ah tai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Vanglien Topa in (a minthanna in kei ei sawl zaw ciengin) note ang bulu minamte tawh kisai-in tam bangin gen hi: A mantahin no ang khoikha pa in keima’ mit nauta a khoikha ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu-in en un, keima in amate langkhatah ka khut ka lamto ding a, amate pen a silate uh’ tomgam van a suoh ding uhi. Tua ciengin Vanglien Topa in kei ei sawl lam note in na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem tanu aw, kipahin la sa in! Azieh pen en in, keima hing pei-in na lah vuah kang teng ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin minam tampite in Topa a pawlpi ding vua, amate pen keima’ mi ahi ding uhi; na lah vuah kang teng ding a, Vanglien Topa in keima ei sawl lam note in na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in gam siengtho sungah ama’ tanh dingin Judah gam luo ding a, Jerusalem a teelkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi zosie aw, Topa mai-ah sip dide un; azieh pen a tenna mun siengtho panin ama ding khie zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in Topa’ vantungmi mai-a a ding siempu lien pa Joshua ei lah a, tuale ama mawsah dingin a ziet lamah Satan a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in Satan kungah, “Satan aw, Topa in nang ang phawhsie hi! Jerusalem a teel Topa in nang ang phawhsie hi! Tam mipa pen mei kuolai pana kiladawh singba hi lo amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu-in Joshua in puon nieh mama silin vantungmi mai-ah a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vantungmi in ama mai-ah a ding mite kungah, “A puon nieh sutpieh un,” a ci hi. Tuale ama kungah, “En in, nangma kung panin na khielna ka ladawh ta hi, tuale puon hoite kang silsah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuale keima in, “Amate in a lu tungah diel siengtho khat khimsah uheh,” ka ci hi. Tuaci’n amate in a lu tungah diel siengtho khat khimsahin puon a silsah uhi; tuale ama kungah Topa’ vantungmi a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ vantungmi in Joshua hlamuon a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Ka lampite tawnin ka deinate na zui leh, ka inn uhin ka huong sung teng na sai ding a, tam sunga a ding mite lahah sungtum pusuo theina thu na nei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siempu lien pa Joshua aw, tu-in nangma le na mai-ah a to na guolte in ngai un! Bangzieh ahei cile amate pen mailam thuhoi nading lim ahi uhi: Keima in Singba a kici ka nasempa kang peisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen Joshua mai-ah, mai sagi a nei suong khat ka phut zo a, tua suong tungah lai ka giel ding a, ni khat sungin tami gam’ khielna ka lamang ding hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin na lenggui ule na theikung uh nei-ah a pei dingin khatlekhat na kiciel ding uhi,” Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei ei hopi vantungmi ang kilekia a, mi khat a kimutna pana a kiphawn bangin ei phong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in keima kungah, “Bang na mu ei?” ei ci hi. Tuale keima in, “A tunga hai khat a nei, kham tawh a kibawl meivah tunna khat ka mu hi; tuami tungah meivah sagi om a, a dawnah kam sagi ciet a nei meivah sagi a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuami gei-ah olive kung ni om a, khat pen hai ziet lamah, adang khat pen hai vei lamah a om hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima ei hopi vantungmi kungah, “Ka pu aw, tamte bang ahiei?” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima ei hopi vantungmi in, “Tamte na thei sih amah?” ci-in ei dawng hi. Keima in, “Thei sing, ka pu aw,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in keima kungah, “Tami pen Zerubbabel kunga a tung Topa’ kammal ahi hi: Thagumhatna hang hi lo, vanglietna hang zong hi lo, keima’ hlagau hang beh tawh ahi hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Muol golpi aw, nang bang na hei? Zerubbabel mai-ah zangtam na suoh ding hi; mite in, ‘Hepina, ama tungah hepina!’ ci-in a awh kawmin ama in inntung khupna suong puokhie ding hi,’ ci-in,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua banah keima kungah Topa’ thu ang tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Zerubbabel’ khut in tam inn khuombul phut zo hi.; ama’ khut tawh a zo sieng ding hi. Tua ciengin Vanglien Topa in na kung vua keima ei sawl ahi lam note in na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile thuneu’ bawl ni a simmaw mi poma a lungdam ding vua, Zerubbabel khut sunga a om tena suongkhai a mu ding uhi. “Tami sagite pen leitung buppi a encih Topa’ mittangte ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama kungah, “Meivah tunna ziet lam le vei lama a om tami olive kungte bang ahiei?” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuale a ni veina ama kungah, “Kham penglawng ni tegel tawh sathau kisunna tami olive singba ni tegel bang ahiei?” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in kei kungah, “Tamte bang ahei ci na thei sih amah?” ei ci hi. Keima in, “Thei sing, ka pu aw,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “Tam tegel pen leitung buppi a uh Topa kunga a ding sathau a kinusa mi nite ahi uhi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka enkia leh a leng laiziel khat ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale ama in kei kungah, “Bang na mu ei?” ei ci hi. Keima in, “A leng laiziel khat ka mu hi; adung tong sawmni, avai tong sawm pha hi,” ci-in ka dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in kei kungah, “Tam pen leitung maitang buppi-ah a vah kawikawi samsietna ahi hi; azieh pen laidal lang khata a kigiel bangin guta zosie kisumaimang ding a, a dal lang khata a kigiel bangin a manlopi-a a kiciem zosie kisumaimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in a genna-ah, keima in tua laidal ka sawl zo ta a, gutate’ inn sung le a man lopi-a ka min tawh a kiciem mite’ inn sungah a lut ding hi; tua inn sungah teng den ding a, a sing a suong pumin tua inn a susie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin kei lamah ei hopi vantungmi ang pei-in keima kungah, “Khuodah inlen tua ang pusuoh pen bang ahei en in,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in, “Tuami bang ahiei?” ka ci hi. Ama in, “Tua ang pusuoh pen law ahi hi,” ei ci hi. Tuale ama in, “Tam pen gam sung zosie-a amau’ khielna ahi hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin hanawh tawh kibawl a husin ang kidomto leh tua law sungah numei khat na to hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuale ama in, “Tam pen Gitlona ahi hi,” ei ci hi. Tuaci’n ama in law sungah tua numei sawnsuhkia-in tua law’ kam tungah hanawh gihna tawh a nensuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin ka khuodah leh kei lamah numei ni ang pei ka mu hi. Ama gel’ hlate sungah hui a om hi; ama gel in gun vapi’ hla tawh a kibang hla a nei vua, van le lei kikalah tua law a lenpito uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima ei hopi vantungmi kungah, “Tua law hei lama a lenpi to uh ahiei?” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in keima kungah, “Tuami ading inn khat lampieh dinga Shinar gama a lenpi uh ahi hi,” ei ci hi. Tua inn a kizaw ciengin amate in a kitunna ding munah tua law a tung ding uhi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuale khatvei ka khuodah leh sumngo muol ni kikal panin leeng li ang pusuoh ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A leeng amasa pen sakol sante in kai a, a nina sakol vomte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a thumna sakol kangte, le a lina sakol pawlte in kai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin ei hopi vantungmi kungah, “Ka pu aw, tamte bang ahiei?” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vantungmi in keima kungah, “Tamte pen leitung buppi a uh Topa mai-ah a kilaa zaw cieng vua ang pusuoh vantung huipi lite ahi hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sakol vomte’ kaih leeng in leilu lam gam manaw-in pei a, sakol kangte’ kaih leeng in nitumna lam gam zuonin pei-in, sakol pawlte’ kaih leeng in leitaw lam manaw-in a pei hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A thahat sakolte ang pei ciengun leitung a vil kawikawi ding uh a ngahla mama uhi. Tuale ama in, “Pei-in leitung va vil un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n amate in leitung a vil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in kei ei awhsan a, “En in, leilu lam gama peite in leilu lam gamah keima’ hlagau a tawlngasah uhi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka tungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Babylon pana ang tung saltangte-Hedai, Tobijah, le Jedaiah-tung panin ngun le khamte khawm in; khum ni ma-in Zephaniah’ tapa Josiah’ inn ah pei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang in ngun le khamte la-in kumpi lukhu khat bawl inlen, Jehozadak’ tapa siempu lien pa Joshua khusah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama kungah tam bangin gen in: Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Tami sungah a min Singba a kici mipa khat a om hi: azieh pen ama’ munah ba mengin Topa’ biehinnpi a lam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa’ biehinnpi lam ding pa khu ama ahi hi; ama in kumpite’ nga zatahna nga ding a, a kumpi topha tungah to-in a uh ding hi. A kumpi topha gei-ah siempu khat om ding a, ama ni kikalah lungmuongin kitheitelna a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua kumpi lukhu pen Topa’ biehinnpi sungah phawna-in Heldai, Tobijah, Jedaiah, le Zephaniah’ tapa Josiah-te kep dingin ki-ap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A gamla panin mite hing pei-in Topa’ biehinnpi a lam hu ding uhi; tuale Topa in note kunga keima ei sawl lam na thei ding uhi. Topa na Pasien uh’ thu na man nah po uleh tam thu ang pieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpi Darius in a uh a kum lina, Chislev a kici a hla kuo na, a ni li ni-in, Zechariah tungah Topa’ thu tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu-in Bethel mite in Sharezer le Regem-melech, a mite utawh Topa’ tungah a thum dingin a sawl vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vanglien Topa’ inn sunga siempute le kamsangte kungah, “Kum tampi sung ka bawlsa bangin a hla ngana sung kapin antang lai ding ka hi uh amah?” ci-in a dongsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin ka kungah Topa’ thu ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gam sung mi zosie le siempute kungah tam bangin gen in: Tam kum sawm sagi sung a hla ngana le a hla sagina sungin an tangin na kaa uh ciengin tua khu kei adinga antang na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Note in na neh na dawn uh ciengin noma dinga an ne tui dawn hi lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem ah mite tengin a kimvela khuote tawh a nopsah lai le Negeb le Shephelah ah mite a ten lai-in kamsangte tungtawnin Topa thugente tam thute ma hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zechariah tungah Topa’ thu tungin tam bangin ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangin gen hi: A manin thukhen unlen khatlekhat tungah migitna le hepina kilah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Meigong, taga, pemta, ahi sihle mizawngte gawt sih un; na lungsim sung vuah khatlekhat kisietsah nading gel sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hizongle amate in ngai nuom loin lungkhau tahin a liengko uh a heisan vua, a zah lo nadingun a bil a hum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thukham le Vanglien Topa in kamsang masate tungtawnin ama’ hlagau tawh a gen thute a zah lo nadingun amate in a lungsim a khausah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima in amate ka hlat ciengin a zah lo uh bang lienin amate in keima ei hlat ciengun ken zong ka za sih ding hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuale keima in a thei ngai nai vawt lo uh minamte lahah amate pumpei tawh ka thezah ding hi. Tua bangin a nuasie uh leitang gamkhing suoh a, tuaci’n gam nuom kimlai koima’ suhva tova nawn lona gamdai a suohsah uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vanglien Topa’ thu ka tungah tam bangin ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangin gen hi: It luotna lienpi tawh Zion ka lainat a, thangpaina lienpi tawh ama ka lainat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Zion ah ka kilekia ding a, Jerusalem laikimah ka teng ding hi; Jerusalem pen a muonhuoi khuopi kici ding a, Vanglien Topa’ muol pen muol siengtho kici ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangin gen hi: A kum a tam seng ziehun puvuoite le pivuoite in a khut ciet vuah ciengkhut a tawi ding vua, Jerusalem lampi tengah a tokia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuale khuopi sunga gawlzing lampi tengah a ki-apmai naupangte le numeite a dim ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Tu hun ciengin a omlai tam mite adingin tam thu pen a hi thei lo ding tawh a kibah vangin, keima adingin ahi thei lo ding tawh a kibang ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Keima in nisuona lam gam le nitumna lam gam panin ka mite ka hundam ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuale Jerusalem-a teng dingin amate ka puoh ding hi. Amate pen munhuoina sung le dihna keima’ mi ahi ding vua, tuale keima zong amau’ Pasien ka hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bang ci hi: Vanglien Topa’ inn ahi biehinnpi a kilamkia nadingin khuombulpi a kiphu hun lai-in a na om kamsangte’ kam sung panin a gen uh thute tu nai-a tua thu a za note in na khut uh khausah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile khum hun masangin mihing ganhing thaman a om sih a, a sungtum le a pusuoh mite adingin galte panin lungmuonna khat zong om loin, amate khatlekhat ka kidosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin tu-in nidanglai huna ka bawl bangin a omlai tam mite tungah ka bawl nawn sih ding hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile lungmuongin khai kitu ding hi; lenggui in a ga ga ding a, leitang in ga piengsahin vantungte in daitui pie ding uhi; tuale tami nate zosie pen tam mipi a oplai teng in ka ngasah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Judah innkuon le Israel innkuonte aw, minamte lahah hamsietin na om ngai ma bangun note hing hundamin mite thupha ngana na hi ding uhi. Zau sih unlen na khutte khausah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen Vanglien Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Na pu na pate un ei thangpaisah lai-un amate tungah gimna tunsah ding sawmin ka lungsim ka khep vawt lo bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tuhun ciengin Jerusalem le Judah innkuon adingin na hoi sep ding ka sawmkia ta hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi; zau vawt sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na sep ding uh tam teng ahi hi: Note khatlekhat thuman thutahin kihopi unlen, na khuopi tunkot vua thukhennate ah thuman le kilemna dingin thu khen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na lungsim sung vuah khat in khat tungah sil hoi lo bawl sawm sih un; azieh pen tamte zosie ka muda hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vanglien Topa thu keima kungah ang tung a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Antan a hla lina, antan a hla ngana, antan a sagina, le antan a hla sawmna teng pen kipahna le lungdamna pawi bawlna hun hi ding a, Judah innkuonte adingin thanopna pawite hi ding hi: tua ahi ziehin thuman thutah le kilemna na dei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Mite le khuopi tampi-a tengte ang pei lai ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />khuopi khat a tengte adang khatah a pei ding vua, “Hing pei un, eite pei-in Topa tungah hepina ngenin Vanglien Topa zong i sui ding uhi; kei mama ka pei ding hi,” a ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jerusalem ah Vanglien Topa a sui ding le Topa tungah hepina a ngen dingin mi tampite le minam thahatte a pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Khum hun ciengin mi namcin lah panin ham tuomtuom a zang pasal sawm khat in Jew mi khat manin a puon tu kawmin, “Nang tawh zawhton vai, bangzieh ahei cile nang tawh Pasien a op lam ka za zo ta uhi,” ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thuphuon Khat. Hadrach gam langkhatah Topa’ thu tung a, Damascus tungah tu ding hi. Aram khuopi pen Topa -a’ ahi ziehin Israel minam zosie zong ama-a’ ma ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tua tawh a kigamgi Hamath zong ama-a’ ahi a, amate a pil vangun Tyre le Sidon zong ama-a’ ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tyre in ama adingin leicien bawl a, ama in leivui sunvum bangin ngun sungvum a, lam dunga buathah bangin khamte a sungvum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin tu-in a neisate Topa in lahpieh ding a, a haunate tuipi sungah paipiehin mei in a katum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ashkelon in tua mu-in a zau ding hi; Gaza zong a lungkhamin kintawm ding hi; a kinepna teng a tawp ziehin Ekron zong tua bang ma hi ding hi. Gaza pan kumpipa mangthai ding a, Ashekelon ah koima teng lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ashdod khuopi ah nam kisawhalte a teng ding vua, keima in Philistia-te’ kiletsahna ka tawpsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima in a kam panin sisan le a haning kawm panin sil kidahhuoite ka ladawh ding hi; a omlai teng zong i Pasien adinga a omlai ahi ding uhi; ama pen Judah gam sungah be khat bangin om ding a, Ekron zong Jebus-te bang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin koima a sungtum a pusuoh a op lo nadingin, ka inn ah giephuol satin a cingin ka om ding hi; mi bawlsie koima in amate a tuoncil nawn sih ding hi, azieh pen tu-in keima in ka mit tawh ka mu zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zion’ tanu aw, nahpi tahin kipah in! Jerusalem tanu aw, a gingin awng in! En in, thumanna le hutdamna ahi na kumpipa kiniemkhieh tahin laa tungah laapi’ ta laano tung tuongin na kungah ang pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in Ephraim panin leengte le, Jerusalem panin galsimna sakolte a sumaimang ding hi; galsim nadinga kizang thaltangte kisumaimang ding a, ama in minamte tungah kilem nading thu pie ding hi; ama uhna tuipi khat pan tuipi khat, Gunpi panin leimong dong hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang adingin zong ahile, nang tawh i thuciemna sisan ziehin, tui op lona leihawm panin na thongkiete ka hla ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lametna a om thongkiete aw, na mun muonhuoi vuah kilekia un; tuni-in nang tungah a zani-a kang pieh ding thu kang gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Azieh pen ka thal bangin Judah ka kuoi zo ta hi; keima in Ephraim pen a thaltangin ka bawl zo hi. Zion aw, a do dingin na tapate ka hantawh ding a, Greece aw, amate in na tapate a do ding uhi. Galhangpa’ namsau bangin nangma kang tawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate kungah Topa kilah ding a, tunphe bangin a thaltang lengkhie ding hi; pengkul tumin leitaw lam pumpei lahah Topa Pasien ang pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in amate dal ding a, amate in suongsepte pumvalin a tuoncil ding uhi; zu bangin a sisan uh a dawn ding vua, tua khu kuong bangin dimin, maitam kiute bangin tehlop ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin Topa a Pasien un ama’ mite tuuhon bangin hundam ding hi; kumpi lukhu-a suongmanpha bangin amate tee dimdiem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama bang za-in hoi-in, ama bangza-in a etlawm diei izaw! An le zu tha in tangvalte le ngahnute a khanphasah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Guo nukhia hun ciengin Topa kung pan guotui ngen un. Huipi meiipite a bawl Topa ahi a, ama in note tungah guotui ang pie a, a koimapo adingin lozau-ah ankung a posah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile teraphim in kimanna a nei lo thu gen a, aisante in zuouthu mu uhi; mangsante in a man lo mangte genin, henepna a hawmpi a pie uhi. Tua ahi ziehin tuu bangin mipite a vahmang sieng vua, tuucing a op lo ziehin gentheina a thuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka tuucingte tungah keima ka lung a so a, keima in makaite tungah dan ka pie ding hi; azieh pen Vanglien Topa in a ganhon, Judah innkuonte kem ding a, a kiphatsahpi gal sakolte bangin amate a bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate sung pan innkiu suong, amate sung pan puonbuh khetphim, amate sung pan galdona thalpi, amate sung pan galkapmang zosie, ang pieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate a unpi-un gawlzin buon lahah galte a tuoncil galhangte a bang ding uhi; amate tawh Topa a opton ziehin amate in gal a do ding vua, sakol tung tuongte a mai zumsah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Judah innkuonte ka thakhausah ding a, Joseph innkuonte ka hundam ding hi. amate tungah lainatna ka nei ziehin, amate ka peipikia ding a, tuale amate pen ka nuol ngai lote tawh a kibang ding uhi; Topa a Pasien uh ka hi ziehin, amate ka dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ephraim mite galhangte tawh a kibang ding vua, zu lungnop bangin a lung nuom ding uhi. A tate in mu-in a kipah ding vua, Topa sungah amate lungdamin a kipah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate tankhie zo ka hi ziehin, amate khutvanin ka kaikhawm ding a, nidang lai bangin amate tampi a pha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Minamte lahah amate ka thezah vangin gamlapi-a om gamte panin amate in ei phawh ding vua, tanu tapate nei-in amate ang peikia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Egypt gam panin inn ah ka peipi ding a, Assyria gam panin ka kaikhawm ding hi; mun in amate a dawl la masangsie Gilead gam le Lebanon ah ka peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in lunggimna tuipi a kansan ding vua, tuipi tuihuolte kivatmai-in, Nile tuithuhte a kanggaw ding hi. Assyria-te’ kiphatsahna kiniemkhieh ding a, Egypt-te’ kumpi ciengkhut a peimang ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa sungah ka thakhausah ding a, ama’ minin a kalsuon ding uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lebanon aw, na taamtah singte mei in a kahtum nadingin, na kotte hong in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Taasing aw, taamtah sing a pua zo ziehin kap in, bangzieh ahei cile singkung minthangte kisie zo hi! Bashan gangpi sing aw, kap in, azieh pen gammang tulah teng kiphua sieng zo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai un, a vangtaa ziehun tuucingte a kap uhi! Ngai un, Jordan hamphulte a kisuhsiet ziehin humpite a hawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka Topa Pasien in tam bang ci hi: Gaw dinga kikoi tuuhonte va cing ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A leite in tuute a go vua, dan a thuoh sih uhi; a zuate in, “Ka haulaw ziehun Topa in thupha nga taheh,” a ci uhi; a tuucingte mama in amate tungah khuotuona a nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin khumi gam sunga a teng zosie ka khuotuo nawn sih ding hi, Topa in ci hi. Mi zosie a unpi-in a innvengpa’ khut sung le kumpipa’ khut sungah ka puasah ciet ding hi; amate in tua gam a susiecip ding vua, keima in a khut sung panun koima ka hunkhie sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n kei pen tuu metbawlte’ gaw dingin tuuhonte a cing pa ka suoh hi. Keima in ciengkhut ni ka la hi; khat pen Angvanna ci-in a min ka phuo a, a khat pen Kipumkhatna ci-in min phuo-in tuute ka cing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate tungah hla khat sungin tuucingte thum ka hemkhie hi, bangzieh ahei amate tungah ka lung a duoi zo nawn sih a, amate in zong kei ei huo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in, “Note kang cing nawn sih ding hi. A si nuom si unlen a sie nuom sie un; a omlai sun teng zong khatlekhat kivaltum un!” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Angvanna a kici ka ciengkhut la-in ka hliehtawng a, mi zosie tawh ka bawlsa ka thuciemna ka phel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum ni-in kiphel a, kei ei vilvil tuu metbawlte in tam pen Topa’ thu ahi lam a thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in amate kungah, “Tami thu man na sah uleh ka thaman ei pie un; man na sah sih uleh tang un,” ka ci hi. Tuaci’n amate in ka thaman dingin ngun shekel sawmthum a te uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in keima kungah, “Tuate sumkholna sungah koi in,” ei ci hi. Amate in tua pen keima a pu uh’ man dinga kituoh a sah uh ahi hi. Tuaci’n keima in ngun shekel sawmthum la-in Topa’ inn sung sumkholna ah tuate ka koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kipumkhatna a kici ka ciengkhut a nina pen ka hliehtawng a, Judah le Israel kikala innkuon kikhaukhina ka phel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in keima kungah tam bangin gen hi: Kimanna a nei lo tuucingpa’ vanzahte khatvei lakia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile keima in gam sungah a mangthaite a don lo, a vahthapte a sui lo, a liemte dam nadinga a kem lo, a cidamte an a vah lo, ahi vangin a thaute netumin a kecin nangawna a pumval tuucingte ka khangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuuhonte a nuasie, kimanna a nei lo ka tuucingpa in samsietna nga taheh! Ka namsau in a ban le a mit zietlam sat taheh! A ban zawcip ta hinlen, a mit zietlam taw taheh!
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thuphuon Khat. Israel tawh kisai-in Topa’ thugen tam bang ahi hi: Vante zahin leitung bulpi phut a, mihingte sungah hlagau a guon Topa in tam bangin ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />En in, Jerusalem khu a kimvela om mite in khamin a hawipua thei nading uh zuhai-in ka bawl ding hi; Jerusalem sung a ki-imtawm ciengin Judah zong ki-imtawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin mi zosie adingin Jerusalem suongtum gih mama khatin ka bawl ding hi; tua suongpi a dom mi zosie amau le amau kinah liemsuo mama ding uhi. Ama a do dingin leitunga minam zosie a peiton ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin keima in sakol zosie ka patausah ding a, a sakol tung tuongte ka mawsah ding hi. Ahi vangin keima in mi zosie’ sakol mit ka tawtsah ciengin mitphe loin Judah innkuonte ka en ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Judah bete amau le amau in, “Jerusalem-a tengte in Vanglien Topa , a Pasien uh tungtawnin thahatna a nga uhi,” ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin keima in Judah bete, singkhuo tunga beel kisuong a so pielpual le butu lahah meila kuong ka bangsah ding hi; tuale amate in a kimvel a ziet a vei-a om mi zosie a valtum ding vua, Jerusalem-a ama’ mun ma-ah mite a tengkia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah tungah David innkuon’ vang le Jerusalem-a tengte’ vang a kitawisang lo nadingin Topa in Judah puonbuhte tungah guolzawna pie masa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin Topa in Jerusalem-a tengte dal ding ahi ziehin, tuaci’n amate lahah a thanem pente Judah bang ding a, David innkuonte Pasien tawh kibangin amate mai-ah Topa’ vantungmi bang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin keima in Jerusalem a sim minam zosie suhsiet dingin ka sui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima in David innkuon le Jerusalem-a tengte tungah lainatna le thungetna lungsim ka sungsuh ding a, tuaci’n a sutpailetsa uh mipa khat enin a tapa neisun kaa bangin a kap ding vua, a tapa masapen kaa bangin nasie tahin a kaa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin Megiddo zanglei-a Hadad-rimmon kaana za ma-in Jerusalem-a kaana lien mama ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua gam kap ding a, David innkuonte a tuomin, a zite a tuomin, Nathan innkuonte a tuomin, a zite a tuomin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Levi innkuonte a tuomin, a zite a tuomin, Shimei innkuonte a tuomin, a zite a tuomin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a omlai a kinuasie innkuonte a tuomin, a zite a tuomin a kap ciet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin David innkuon le Jerusalem-a tengte’ mawna le a sientho lonate uh a sawp sieng dingin tuinah khat kipulsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin amate a kiphaw nawn lo nadingin keima in gam sung panin milimte’ min teng ka sumaimang ding hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi; gam sung panin kamsangte le hla buate zong ka sumaimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kamsang khat po ang pienkia leh a pienna a nu le a pa in amate kungah, “Topa’ minin zuouthu gen na hi ziehin na hing sih ding hi,” ci ding uhi; tuale amate in mailam thu a gen ciengun a pienna a nu le a pa in amate dawtlia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin kamsang poma in mailam thu a gen ciengun a mangmuna ziehun maizum ding uhi; mi sol nadingin amate in a kamsang samul puonhampi a sil sih ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ahi vangin amate khat ciet in, “Kei kamsang ka hi sih a, lohlo mi khat ka hi bo hi; azieh pen ka neu lai-a kipanin tam leitang keima’ neisa ahi hi,” ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi khatpo in, “Na awm-a tam liemmate bang ahiei?” ci-in amate a dawh leh, “Ka guolpa inna ka liemna ahi hi,” ci-in dawng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Namsau aw, ka tuucingpa le ka naseppi pa sat dingin tho in,” Vanglien Topa in ci hi. Tuute a kithethang nadingin tuucingpa sat in; keima in tuunote langkhatah ka khut ka vih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Gam bup ah sethum-suo- seni kisumangin a mangthai ding vua, sethum-suo-sekhat pen a hingin kinuasie ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam sethum pen meikuolai-ah koi-in, mi khat in ngun a siensah bangin ka siengsah ding a, kham a kize-et bangin tuate ka ze-et ding hi. Amate in ka min ei lo ding vua, amate ka dawng ding hi. “Amate pen ka mite ahi uhi,” ka ci ding hi. Amate in, “ Topa in eite’ Pasien ahi hi,” a ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />En in, Topa’ ni ang tun ciengin na kung pana van kilate note lahah kihawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem sim dingin minam zosie ka khawm ding a, khuopi kila-in innte kibulu ding a, numeite kibuon gawp ding hi; khuopi alang salin kikai ding a, ahi vangin khuopi sunga a omlai teng kisumaimang lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa kuonin gal kido huna kido bangin tua minamte a do ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin Jerusalem nisuona lama a om Olive Muol tungah a keng tawh ama a ding ding hi; nisuona lam pan nitumna lam dong Olive Muol phal ni kisuo ding hi; tuaci’n Muol alang khat leilu lamah kikhinin, alang khat leitaw lamah kikhin ding a, kuompi gol mama khat pieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Note na hi uleh, Topa’ muol kuom tawnin na tai ding uhi, azieh pen muol tegel kikala om tua kuom in Azal dong ban ding hi; tuale Judah Kumpi Uzziah hunin zil lingin na taimang bangun na taimang ding uhi. Tua ciengin Topa ka Pasien hing pei-in a misiengthote zosie ang zawpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin khuodam ahi a, vuokieh ahi zongin a om sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kizom ni om ding a, (tua pen Topa in a thei ni khat hi ding a) sun hun, zan hun ci om lo ding hi, azieh pen nitah hun ciengin khuovah om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khum hun ciengin Jerusalem panin hinna tui luongkhie ding a, alang pen nisuona lam tuipi ah, alang khat pen nitumna lam tuipi ah luong ding hi; phalbi lai bangin khuokhal lai-in zong luong den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leitung zosie ah Topa , pen kumpi a suoh ding hi; khum ni ciengin Topa khat beh hi ding a, a min zong khat beh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Geba panin Jerusalem leitaw lam Rimmon dongin gam buppi zanglei suoh ding hi. Ahi vangin Jerusalem pen Benjamin’ Tunkot panin tunkot masa le Kiu Tunkot dong, le Hananel Tausang panin kumpipa’ lenggazu suhna dongin a tuomin a opna ngai-ah om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua khuopi ah kiteng ding hi, bangzieh ahei cile tua khuopi kisusiekia ngai nawn lo ding hi; Jerusalem lungmuongtahin a om ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in Jerusalem tunga gal bawl mite zosie tami pul natna tawh vatmai ding hi: A keng utawh a ding laipima-in a sa uh muottop ding hi; A mitbu sung vuah a mittangte uh muotin, a kam sung vuah a lei uh a muottop ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin Topa tung panin amate tungah patauna lienpi khat tung ding a, tuaci’n mi khat ciet in a vengpa khut man ding a, mi khat in adang khat dona-in a khut uh a lam ciet ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah minamte nangawn in Jerusalem ah a do ding uhi. Amau’ kimvela a om minamte’ hauna zosie-kham, ngun, le puonsilte tampi tah kikhop siengpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tam pul natna tawh a kibang pul natna pen sakolte, kalaohte, laate tung, le giephuolte sunga om ganhing zosie kungah tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jerusalem a sim minamte lah panin a suohta lai zosie in Vanglien Topa bie ding le buh pawi sim dingin kumsimin Jerusalem ah kato ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vanglien Topa Kumpipa bie dingin leitunga om innkuonte a koimapo Jerusalem ah a kuonto sih uleh, amate tungah guo a zu sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Egypt innkuonte kuonto loin amate mama a va op sih uleh, Topa in buh pawi sim dinga a kuonto lo minamte tunga a tunsah pul natna, amate tungah a tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua bang pen buh pawi sim dinga a kuonto lo minamte zosie le Egypt-te’ thuoh ding dan hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin sakol lawngte tungah, “ Topa dingin a Siengtho,” ci-in kigiel ding hi. Topa’ inn sunga an beelte, maitam mai-a kuongkumte bangin siengtho ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tuale biehpiehna pie mi zosie pei-in biehna sa huon nadingin tuate a zah thei nadingun Jerusalem khuo sung le Judah gam sunga anbeel zosie Vanglien Topa adingin a siengtho ding hi. Khum hun ciengin Vanglien Topa’ inn sungah sumbawlte om nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
</usx>
